{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#card-zh","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 是一款 DSH Web 和 Desktop 插件，可把会话中的 Mermaid 代码块渲染成可交互图表。客户端识别代码块，并从 DSH 同源路由按需加载内置 Mermaid 运行时。用户可以切换代码与图形、全屏缩放和拖动画布、下载 SVG；插件也适配流式回复、深浅主题和中英文界面。适合在阅读技术讨论或工作流时查看图表。无需额外 API Key 或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:12-20","src/client.js:137-145","src/client.js:281-350","src/viewer.js:25-67","src/index.js:7-29"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#card-en","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Mermaid renders Mermaid code blocks as diagrams in DSH chats. It loads the bundled runtime from a same-origin route. Users can switch views, zoom and pan fullscreen, and download SVG files. It supports streamed replies and English or Simplified Chinese controls.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:12-20","src/client.js:137-145","src/client.js:281-350","src/viewer.js:25-67","src/index.js:7-29"]}
