{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#feature-blocks","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 的功能「代码块识别与渲染」：识别 mermaid、mermaidjs、mmd 围栏代码块，并将 Mermaid 源码渲染为 SVG；无语言标记时也识别已知图类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/detection.js:1-29","src/client.js:137-145","src/client.js:314-350"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#feature-toggle","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 的功能「视图切换」：每张图表卡片提供代码和图形按钮，用户可随时切换；视图变化时尽量维持会话中的阅读位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:145-155","src/client.js:202-280","src/scroll.js:18-35"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#feature-fullscreen","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 的功能「全屏浏览」：全屏查看器支持滚轮缩放、拖动平移、适应窗口或重置到 100%；按 Esc 或关闭按钮退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/viewer.js:12-35","src/viewer.js:151-199","src/client.js:479-482"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#feature-export","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 的功能「SVG 导出」：图表成功渲染后，点击下载按钮即可把当前 SVG 序列化并保存为独立文件，文件名包含图表类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:185-200","src/client.js:337-344"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#feature-streaming","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 的功能「流式回复适配」：观察会话 DOM 中新增或变化的代码块，延迟并串行安排渲染；过期结果会被忽略，源码清空或组件卸载时会清理卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:353-410","src/client.js:426-449"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#feature-localization","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 的功能「主题与语言适配」：跟随 DSH 深浅主题渲染图表，并依据页面和浏览器语言显示英文或简体中文控件及状态提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:80-113","src/client.js:113-122","src/client.js:461-478"]}
{"unit_id":"MrmoLabs__dsh-mermaid#caveat-limit","repo":"MrmoLabs/dsh-mermaid","commit":"e537750ea1f1191931d5c1946cbe261822442fe6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mermaid 使用前须知：单个 Mermaid 源码超过 50,000 个字符或 2,000 行时会被拒绝渲染；发生渲染错误时显示源码视图。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:14-16","src/client.js:300-312","src/client.js:345-350"]}
